{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SwMrdhYjXUUudzX11y1LB4","type":"tool_result","content":"278\t/// Spin-bit variant policy.\n279\t#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Default)]\n280\t#[repr(u8)]\n281\tpub enum SpinbitVersion {\n282\t    /// Default behaviour, per the spin-bit draft.\n283\t    #[default]\n284\t    Basic = 0,\n285\t    /// Randomise per packet.\n286\t    Random = 1,\n287\t    /// Null behaviour, randomised per path.\n288\t    Null = 2,\n289\t    /// Test-only \"always on\" mode.  Not valid as a per-connection\n290\t    /// override (server only; see [`Quic::set_default_spinbit_policy`]).\n291\t    On = 3,\n292\t}\n293\t\n294\t/// Loss-bit support level.\n295\t#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Default)]\n296\t#[repr(u8)]\n297\tpub enum LossbitVersion {\n298\t    /// Loss bits disabled.\n299\t    #[default]\n300\t    None = 0,\n301\t    /// This endpoint sets the loss bits but does not interpret peer's.\n302\t    SendOnly = 1,\n303\t    /// This endpoint both sets and receives loss bits.\n304\t    SendReceive = 2,\n305\t}\n306\t\n307\t/// Path scheduling status — whether a path participates in normal"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"883038f3-dc47-41ca-bc79-c1df5243c1d6","uuid":"5ba0d3aa-8244-4ce5-b95c-e2104889d9b5","timestamp":"2026-05-07T09:25:50.291Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/lib.rs","content":"/// Spin-bit variant policy.\n#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Default)]\n#[repr(u8)]\npub enum SpinbitVersion {\n    /// Default behaviour, per the spin-bit draft.\n    #[default]\n    Basic = 0,\n    /// Randomise per packet.\n    Random = 1,\n    /// Null behaviour, randomised per path.\n    Null = 2,\n    /// Test-only \"always on\" mode.  Not valid as a per-connection\n    /// override (server only; see [`Quic::set_default_spinbit_policy`]).\n    On = 3,\n}\n\n/// Loss-bit support level.\n#[derive(Debug, Co